{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370110","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1037011001:0":{"text":"적어도 20년 전 이야기예요. 제가 젊을 때니까요.","source_cn":"那起码是二十个落叶季之前的事了，那时的我还很年轻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD69843A1C276EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037011002:0":{"text":"모두들 이미르더러 선한 사람이라고 했어요. 뛰어난 지혜로 명성이 자자했죠.","source_cn":"人人都说伊米尔是善人，他充满智慧，贤名远扬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA6D2617B860E02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037011003:0":{"text":"아참, 당시 이미르는 외모도 멋졌어요.","source_cn":"对了，那时候的伊米尔长相也很英俊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE62618FA373C9F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1037011004:0":{"text":"쳇! 그것 때문에 이미르한테 홀려서 지금까지 진실을 부정하는구먼!","source_cn":"哼！所以你才会被他迷惑，到现在还不愿认清真相！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61F392CE82BE4C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1037011005:0":{"text":"영감, 나랑 싸우자는 거야?","source_cn":"老头子，你是想和我吵架吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD5AC5AC8A7EFC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民芙妮妮":{"text":"프니니","source":"村民芙妮妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村民瑞宁":{"text":"레닌","source":"村民瑞宁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}